## Cohesion Audit: `src/blog/people/drafts/Naval-Ravikant.md`

### Central Thesis
Naval is a Type 5 whose defining move is **publication**: he converts private understanding into a portable artifact so he never has to be in the room, which is why the man who calls desire a contract also published a guide to getting rich.

